DTEND:20260509T034500Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T020000Z
UID:iA9gVEHeFX
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nIt is our great pleasure to open 
 our ShortsFest Spotlight with this collection of superb films from around 
 the world: whether narrative or documentary\, live action or animation—t
 hese films prove short is truly sweet.Filmmakers scheduled to attend.\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/festival/shortsfest-opening-night-x41555\n\nEstimated 
 start: 19:10
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
