DESCRIPTION:Duration: 95 mins (1h35m)\n\nPari and Hanna are best friends a
 nd active participants in Tehran’s vibrant underground arts scene. But t
 he risk of running afoul of the government is omnipresent\, forcing diffic
 ult decisions.Director Hossein Keshavarz and Maryam Ataei scheduled to att
 end.  This film is generously sponsored by Lynn Dissinger.\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/festival/the-friends-house-is-here\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Upt
 own House 3 (Sat 9 May\, 2:15 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 20:40
