SUMMARY:Broken English
DTSTART:20260509T043000Z
DTEND:20260509T062000Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T043000Z
UID:wiRlqPWm24
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 99 mins (1h39m)\n\nSinger-songwriter and actress Mar
 ianne Faithfull is too big for a simple documentary. Instead\, a theatrica
 l “Department of Not Forgetting” interweaves intimate interviews\, arc
 hival clips\, and newly recorded performances to conjure a holistic unders
 tanding of a career spanning more than half a century.\n\nhttps://www.siff
 .net/festival/broken-english\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 3 (Fr
 i 15 May\, 12:30 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 21:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
