 f a horrific and bloody chain of events in this darkly comic\, twisted hor
 ror fable from writer/director Curry Barker.Actor Cooper Tomlinson schedul
 ed to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/obsession\n\nEstimated star
 t: 0:09
