DTEND:20260516T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260516T213000Z
UID:ZfGbQv2R8o
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 106 mins (1h46m)\n\nPowwow People immerses us in a s
 ingle day at a powwow\, guided by Reuben Little Head’s humor and heart\,
  culminating in a long take honoring community as privilege. Director Sky 
 Hopinka (Ho-Chunk Nation/Pechanga Band of Luiseño Indians) and Impact Pro
 ducer Amber Morning Star Byars scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/festival/powwow-people\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 2 (Sun 17
  May\, 4:30 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 14:40
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
