SUMMARY:The Big Cheese
DTSTART:20260517T011500Z
DTEND:20260517T031000Z
DTSTAMP:20260517T011500Z
UID:FVZiknLaWm
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nAdam “Mr. Moo” Moskowitz is 
 on a mission to make the world take American cheesemongers seriously. For 
 over a decade\, he’s led a team of eccentric misfits to the Olympics of 
 Cheese\, where Team USA has never won. Could this be their year? Director 
 Sara Joe Wolansky and Subjects Courtney Johnson & Adam Moskowitz schedul
 ed to attend. After the film on Sat\, May 16\, pass and ticket-holders ca
 n head over to Tin Lizzie for an udderly delicious cheese tasting\, courte
 sy of Street Cheese and Peterson Cheese\, with custom wine pairings availa
 ble for purchase. It will surely stink. Wink.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/fest
 ival/the-big-cheese\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • Uptown House 3 (Sun 17 May\
 , 1:30 PM)\n\nEstimated start: 18:25
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
