UID:RpixdHlAr8
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 116 mins (1h56m)\n\nOn December 30\, 2000\, friends 
 climbing Mount Balandrau in the Catalan Pyrenees get caught in a sudden\, 
 savage blizzard. Visibility vanishes\, winds roar\, and survival becomes a
  desperate fight against one of the mountain’s deadliest storms. Produce
 r Guille Cascante scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/ba
 landrau-where-the-fierce-wind-blew\n\nEstimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Happy Birthday
DTSTART:20260518T013000Z
DTEND:20260518T032000Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T013000Z
UID:KSEMPwFxok
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nEight-year-old Toha has big plans
 \; she wants to throw her friend Nelly a birthday party. But the differenc
 es between them will make this a challenge in ways she may not fully under
 stand. This film is generously sponsored by Xixi & Jonathan Shakes.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/festival/happy-birthday\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:PACCAR IMAX Theater at Pacific Science Center\, None
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Invite
DTSTART:20260518T020000Z
DTEND:20260518T040500Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T020000Z
UID:g2wD31Ftqe
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nJoe and Angela’s marriage is o
 n thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinn
 er party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited t
 he spark or lit the match that burns it all down? Director & star Olivia 
 Wilde scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-invite\n\n
 Estimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Furious
DTSTART:20260518T024500Z
DTEND:20260518T045500Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T024500Z
UID:lgcftBKvHW
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 113 mins (1h53m)\n\nAfter the daughter of Wang Wei (
 Xie Miao) is kidnapped by a criminal network and he receives no help from 
 the corrupt police\, Wei sets out on a rampage to find her himself. His on
 ly ally is Navin (Joe Taslim) – a relentless journalist whose wife has m
 ysteriously disappeared. Fueled by a furious vengeance\, the unlikely duo 
 ruthlessly fights against the kidnappers in this explosive martial arts sh
 owdown.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/the-furious\n\nEstimated start: 2
 0:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:RADIOHEART: The Drive and Times of DJ Kevin Cole
DTSTART:20260518T030000Z
DTEND:20260518T044000Z
DTSTAMP:20260518T030000Z
UID:kvibpJeXnB
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 83 mins (1h23m)\n\nIn his 25-year tenure at KEXP\, D
 J Kevin Cole helped define not just who Seattle listens to\, but how we li
 sten\, fostering delight and curiosity with every recommendation. RADIOHEA
 RT\, a bio-doc about Cole’s remarkable life\, boasts a killer soundtrack
 \, a wealth of nostalgic archival footage\, and cameos from Seattle musica
 l legends.Directors Peter Hilgendorf and Andrew Franks\, plus Producer Reb
 ecca Staffel and Subject Kevin Cole scheduled to attend.This film is gener
 ously sponsored by David Prokopy.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/radiohe
 art-the-drive-and-times-of-dj-kevin-cole\n\nEstimated start: 20:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
